  "id": "39174bf7-b74c-4b11-8c6f-822a7e301a58",
  "message": "Besides the mechanic, I’m backed by a handful of specialists.  \n\nWe have analysts who look at different payment types – one for cash purchases, one for card purchases, one for bank‑transfer payments, and another for “other” methods like checks. A receipt scanner matches scanned images to expense records, and an expense reconciler spots rows that are missing receipts.  \n\nThe synthesizer pulls all those mapper reports together, flags odd amounts or possible new recurring bills, and the progress checker tells us which reports already exist and how fresh they are. We also have a spreadsheet maker for single‑category expense sheets and a reshaper that can split a combined spreadsheet into separate columns per person.  \n\nAnd of course there’s Mazda, the bookkeeping agent who handles statements and receipts on her own dashboard.",
